repository-code: "https://github.com/federicogmz/raptor"
url: "https://github.com/federicogmz/raptor"
abstract: >-
  Containerized photogrammetry pipeline for DJI UAVs (Mavic 3T, Matrice 300 RTK
  with Zenmuse H20T, Mavic 3 Multispectral). It produces georeferenced RGB and
  radiometric thermal orthomosaics, vegetation indices (NDVI, GNDVI, NDRE,
  MSAVI2), digital surface models, 3D point clouds, and an interactive Leaflet
  geovisor, running the whole pipeline in a single Docker container with the DJI
  Thermal SDK included. Designed for rapid post-event assessment of landslides
  and debris flows.
keywords:
  - "photogrammetry"
  - "orthomosaic"
  - "remote sensing"
